      "text": "[Product: Alvik] [Product category: Education] [Element of Alvik: None] [Tutorial about Alvik: None] \n\n2.1 Topology\nThe main parts of the robot are the following:\nAlvik's main part from top to bottom (left) and bottom to top (right)\nArduino® Nano ESP32, Quantity = 1. Arduino® Nano ESP32, Details = Main controller of the robot. Main PCB, Quantity = 1. Main PCB, Details = Main PCB of the robot. STM32 Arm® Cortex®-M4 32 Bit, Quantity = 1. STM32 Arm® Cortex®-M4 32 Bit, Details = Onboard STM32 auxiliary controller. Touch Programmable button, Quantity = 7. Touch Programmable button, Details = Touch programmable buttons integrated on the main PCB. ON/OFF Power Switch, Quantity = 1. ON/OFF Power Switch, Details = Assembled on the main PCB. RGB LED, Quantity = 2. RGB LED, Details = Fully programmable RGB LED mounted on the main PCB. Color Sensor, Quantity = 1. Color Sensor, Details = RGB Color detector. 6-Axis Gyro/Accelerometer, Quantity = 1. 6-Axis Gyro/Accelerometer, Details = 6-Axis Gyro and Accelerometer sensor. Front PCB, Quantity = 1. Front PCB, Details = Robot auxiliary PCB with additional sensors. ToF Distance Sensor, Quantity = 1. ToF Distance Sensor, Details = Time-of-Flight Distance sensor up to 350 cm , mounted on the Front PCB. Line follower array, Quantity = 1. Line follower array, Details = Line follower array made up of 3 phototransistors and 4 infrared LEDs, mounted on the front PCB. Grove Connector, Quantity = 2. Grove Connector, Details = I2C Grove Connector to extend robot's capabilities\nQwiic Connector, Quantity = 2. Qwiic Connector, Details = I2C Qwiic Connector to extend robot capabilities. Servomotor Connector, Quantity = 2. Servomotor Connector, Details = 3-pins connector to attach servomotors. 18650 Li-Ion Battery, Quantity = 1. 18650 Li-Ion Battery, Details = Battery of the robot. Main Chassis, Quantity = 1. Main Chassis, Details = Main chassis of the robot made in plastic. Motor holder, Quantity = 2. Motor holder, Details = Plastic support to hold the motor in place, a screwdriver is required to open it. Motors, Quantity = 2. Motors, Details = DC Motor with magnetic relative encoder. Rubber wheel, Quantity = 2. Rubber wheel, Details = Rubber wheel with 34 mmof diameter. Inox steal ball9mm, Quantity = 1. Inox steal ball9mm, Details = Ball that serves as third support for stability. Ball caster holder, Quantity = 1. Ball caster holder, Details = Plastic support to hold the steal ball. INOX M3 x 5 mmScrews, Quantity = 5. INOX M3 x 5 mmScrews, Details = Phillips Screws of the robot. Battery cover, Quantity = 1. Battery cover, Details = Cover to hold the battery, a screwdriver is required to open it",
