      "text": "[Product: Make Your UNO Kit] [Product category: Kits] [Element of Make Your UNO Kit: None] [Tutorial about Make Your UNO Kit: None] \n\n2.1 Recommended Operating Conditions\nConservative thermal limits for the whole board, Min = -40 °C (-40 °F). Conservative thermal limits for the whole board, Max = 85 °C ( 185 °F)\nNOTE: In extreme temperatures, the EEPROM, voltage regulator, and the crystal oscillator, might not work as expected due to the temperature conditions.",
