      "text": "[Product: MKR IoT Carrier] [Product category: MKR Family] [Element of MKR IoT Carrier: None] [Tutorial about MKR IoT Carrier: None] \n\nDescription\nThe Arduino® MKR IoT Carrier provides infinite possibilities for IoT projects.\nThe integrated sensors, circuits and display leave you free to focus on programming and prototyping your ideas.",
      "product_category": "MKR Family",
      "chunk_id": "MKR IoT Carrier-datasheet::c0"
