rs. Audio Synth Shield, Audio Synth Shield.Details = 5x 10kΩ - Trimmer potentiometer - User programmable 1x 10kΩ - Trimmer potentiometer - Directly connected to the audio amplifier. Audio Synth Shield, Audio Synth Shield.Details = 5x 10kΩ - Trimmer potentiometer - User programmable 1x 10kΩ - Trimmer potentiometer - Directly connected to the audio amplifier. Audio Synth Shield, Audio Synth Shield.Details = Audio. Audio Synth Shield, Audio Synth Shield.Details = Amplifier: LM386. Audio Synth Shield, Audio Synth Shield.Details = Class-AB 4Ω Load 0.325W. Audio Synth Shield, Audio Synth Shield.Details = . Audio Synth Shield, Audio Synth Shield.Details = Speaker: L50EJ. Audio Synth Shield, Audio Synth Shield.Details = Impedance @2kHz: 8Ω Max Power 0.5W Output: 81dB +-3dB Diameter 45mm Weight: 48g. Audio Synth Shield, Audio Synth Shield.Details = . Audio Synth Shield, Audio Synth Shield.Details = . Audio Synth Shield, Audio Synth Shield.Details = . Audio Synth Shield, Audio Synth Shield.Details = . Audio Synth Shield, Audio Synth Shield.Details = . Audio Synth Shield, Audio Synth Shield.Details =",
