      "text": "[Product: DIN Celsius] [Product category: Education] [Element of DIN Celsius: None] [Tutorial about DIN Celsius: None] \n\n1 Functional Overview\nThese are the main components of the board, other secondary components, i.e. resistors or capacitors, are not listed.\n1, Function = temperature sensor. 1, Description = TMP236A2DBZR IC SENSOR. 4, Function = left heating circuit. 4, Description = RES CHIP 1210 1k2 1% 1/2W. 4, Function = right heating circuit. 4, Description = RES CHIP 1210 1k2 1% 1/2W. 2, Function = heating status. 2, Description = LED SMD 0603 RED. 1, Function = power status. 1, Description = LED SMD 0603 GREEN. 1, Function = power connector. 1, Description = CONN SCREW TERMINAL, pitch 5mm, 4POS, 16A, 450V, 2.5mm 2. 1, Function = input / output connectors. 1, Description = CONN SCREW TERMINAL, pitch 5mm, 3POS, 16A, 450V, 2.5mm 2. 1, Function = protect from reverse polarity. 1, Description = DIODE SCHOTTKY SMD 2A 60V SOD123FL",
