      "product": "DIN Celsius",
      "file": "docling_chunks.jsonl",
      "text": "[Product: DIN Celsius] [Product category: Education] [Element of DIN Celsius: None] [Tutorial about DIN Celsius: None] \n\n5 Compatible Boards\nArduino Opta® RS485, SKU = AFX00001. Arduino Opta® RS485, Min voltage = 12 V. Arduino Opta® RS485, Max voltage = 24 V. Arduino Opta® WiFi, SKU = AFX00002. Arduino Opta® WiFi, Min voltage = 12 V. Arduino Opta® WiFi, Max voltage = 24 V. Arduino Opta® Lite, SKU = AFX00003. Arduino Opta® Lite, Min voltage = 12 V. Arduino Opta® Lite, Max voltage = 24 V. Arduino® Portenta Machine Control, SKU = AKX00032. Arduino® Portenta Machine Control, Min voltage = 24 V. Arduino® Portenta Machine Control, Max voltage = 24 V. Arduino® DIN Simul8, SKU = ABX00097. Arduino® DIN Simul8, Min voltage = 24 V. Arduino® DIN Simul8, Max voltage = 24 V\nNote: Please turn to each board's datasheet for further information about power and their capacity.",
