      "text": "[Product: Opta] [Product category: Opta Family] [Element of Opta: None] [Tutorial about Opta: None] \n\n3.4 Communication\nEthernet, Type = 10/100BASE-T Port. Ethernet, Protocols/Technologies Supported = TCP/IP, MODBUS TCP. RS-485, Type = Half-duplex without termination resistance. RS-485, Protocols/Technologies Supported = MODBUS RTU, Custom serial communication. Expansion Port, Type = Proprietary Port. Expansion Port, Protocols/Technologies Supported = Expansion module communication. Wireless Connectivity, Type = Wi-Fi®. Wireless Connectivity, Protocols/Technologies Supported = 2.4 GHz. Wireless Connectivity, Type = Bluetooth® Low Energy. Wireless Connectivity, Protocols/Technologies Supported = 4.2 supported by firmware, 5.1 supported by hardware",
      "product_category": "Opta Family",
