    {
      "product": "Opta Analog Expansion A0602",
      "file": "docling_chunks.jsonl",
      "text": "[Product: Opta Analog Expansion A0602] [Product category: Opta Family] [Element of Opta Analog Expansion A0602: None] [Tutorial about Opta Analog Expansion A0602: None] \n\n4.1 Product View\nArduino Opta® Analog Expansion\n3a, Feature = Power Supply Terminals 12...24 VDC. 3b, Feature = P1...P4 PWMOutputs. 3c, Feature = Power Status LED. 3d, Feature = Analog Input/Output Terminals I1...I2 (Voltage, Current, RTD 2 wires and RTD 3 wires). 3e, Feature = Status LEDs 1...8. 3f, Feature = Port for communication and connection of auxiliary modules. 3g, Feature = Analog Input/Output Terminals I3...I6 (Voltage, Current, RTD 2 wires). 3h, Feature = Analog Input/Output Terminals O1...O2 (Voltage, Current, RTD 2 wires)",
      "product_category": "Opta Family",
