      "product_category": "MKR Family",
      "chunk_id": "MKR IoT Carrier-datasheet::c15"
    },
    {
      "product": "MKR IoT Carrier",
      "file": "docling_chunks.jsonl",
      "text": "[Product: MKR IoT Carrier] [Product category: MKR Family] [Element of MKR IoT Carrier: None] [Tutorial about MKR IoT Carrier: None] \n\n2.3 Solution Overview\nSolution overview\nThe MKR IoT Carrier is also a part of the Arduino® Oplà IoT Kit, that in addition to the carrier contains an MKR WiFi 1010, a motion sensor, moisture sensor, USB cable and a protective case.",
      "product_category": "MKR Family",
      "chunk_id": "MKR IoT Carrier-datasheet::c18"
    },
    {
      "product": "MKR IoT Carrier",
      "file": "docling_chunks.jsonl",
      "text": "[Product: MKR IoT Carrier] [Product category: MKR Familiy] [Element of MKR IoT Carrier: None] [Tutorial about MKR IoT Carrier: Tutorial_MKR IoT Carrier] \n\n< Go Back Hardware MKR loT Carrier v Tutorials MkR loT Carrier User Manual loT Smart Garden Setup with MKR loT Carrier Q Search on Docs Home / Hardware / MKRIoT Carrier / loT Smart Garden Setup with MKR loT Carrier loT Smart Garden Setup with MKR loT Carrier Build a smart garden setup with the MkKR loT Carrier, a pump, and a moisture sensor. Jacob Hylén, Hannes Last . revision Séderby MKR IOT CARRIER Smart garden setup with MKR loT Carrier. Decorating your home with plants is an easy way to bring some life into your day-to-day. The only problem is - those plants need water to survive, and if you forget to pay attention to them for a while you may need to start over. So instead of staying ever vigilant, why don't you spend an afternoon creating a setup that will let you both monitor the amount of moisture in your plants soil, and water your plants from afar using the Arduino Cloud?",
      "product_category": "MKR Familiy",
      "chunk_id": "Tutorial_MKR IoT Carrier_IoT Smart Garden Setup::c0"
    }
