      "file": "docling_chunks.jsonl",
      "text": "[Product: Braccio Carrier] [Product category: Education] [Element of Braccio Carrier: None] [Tutorial about Braccio Carrier: None] \n\nJAX133T-IF05\n- Display module to allow Braccio ++ to deploy visual information. The module is based on 240RGBX240 DotMatrix TFT LCD via FPC interface. It is possible to interconnect via Display Connector J1 found on Arduino® Braccio Carrier.",
      "product_category": "Education",
      "chunk_id": "Braccio Carrier-datasheet::c8"
