    {
      "product": "Opta",
      "file": "docling_chunks.jsonl",
      "text": "[Product: Opta] [Product category: Opta Family] [Element of Opta: None] [Tutorial about Opta: None] \n\n5.8 USB-C®\nThe USB-C® port can be used as a host or as a peripheral, but it cannot be used for both purposes at the same time. It is possible to use the connector to power the processor and flash it, but not to power the PLC outputs and peripherals. Additionally and using a USB memory stick, the USB-C® connector can be used for data logging purposes or to update the program inside the PLC.",
