      "text": "[Product: Alvik] [Product category: Education] [Element of Alvik: None] [Tutorial about Alvik: None] \n\n1.5.2 RGB LEDs\nAlvik has two fully programmable RGB LEDs named DL1 and DL2 at its top.\nRGB LED Left, Information = DL1. RGB LED Right, Information = DL2",
      "product_category": "Education",
