      "product": "Alvik",
      "file": "docling_chunks.jsonl",
      "text": "[Product: Alvik] [Product category: Education] [Element of Alvik: None] [Tutorial about Alvik: None] \n\n1.1 General Specifications Overview\nAlvik is an educational robot that is battery-powered and has multiple sensors and actuators, like color detection, distance, line following, accelerometer, gyroscope and much more.\nAlvik's Main Components\nAlvik on-board Core, Description = STM32 Arm® Cortex®-M4 32 Bit. Alvik Main Controller, Description = Arduino® Nano ESP32. Connectivity, Description = Wi-Fi®, Bluetooth® LE. Sensors, Description = RGB Color detection, Distance ToF 8x8 Array - up to 350 cm, IMU - 6 degree, 3x Line follower, 7x Touch sensor. Motors, Description = High precision with hall effect encoder. Up to 13 cm/s. Extensions, Description = Servo motor, I2C Grove, Qwiic, Lego® Technic™, M3x5 mmScrews",
      "product_category": "Education",
