      "text": "[Product: Nicla Vision] [Product category: Nicla Family] [Element of Nicla Vision: None] [Tutorial about Nicla Vision: None] \n\nDescription\nThe Arduino® Nicla Vision packs machine vision capabilities on the edge into a tiny fingerprint. Record, analyze and upload to the Cloud with the help of one Arduino® Nicla Vision . Leverage the onboard camera, STM32 microcontroller, Wi-Fi®/Bluetooth® module and 6-axis IMU to create your wireless sensor network for machine vision applications.",
      "product_category": "Nicla Family",
      "chunk_id": "Nicla Vision-datasheet::c0"
    },
