      "product": "Nano 33 BLE",
      "file": "docling_chunks.jsonl",
      "text": "[Product: Nano 33 BLE] [Product category: Nano Family] [Element of Nano 33 BLE: None] [Tutorial about Nano 33 BLE: None] \n\nDescription\nArduino® Nano 33 BLE is a miniature sized module containing a NINA B306 module, based on Nordic nRF52480 and containing an Arm® Cortex®-M4F and a 9-axis IMU. The module can either be mounted as a DIP component (when mounting pin headers), or as a SMT component, directly soldering it via the castellated pads.",
      "product_category": "Nano Family",
