    {
      "product": "Node Red",
      "file": "docling_chunks.jsonl",
      "text": "[Product: Node Red] [Product category: Arduino Cloud] [Element of Node Red: None] [Tutorial about Node Red: None] \n\nNote: this tutorial requires a subscription to the e Arduino Cloud, all three subscriptions (Entry, Maker & Maker Plus) are valid. Introduction Goals Hardware & Software Requirements Node-RED Setup The Node-RED Editor Setting Up a Thing Communicating with Node-R#D Further Applications + Goals Set up Node-RED with the Arduino Cloud. Use simple Flows with Node-RED. Build a Node-RED Flow that pulls data from Arduino Cloud. Manipulate data received from the Arduino Cloud using JavaScript code. Send email notifications with data from the Arduino Cloud. Hardware & Software Requirements Arduino Create Agent Node.js and Node-RED installed An Arduino account. For this tutorial, you will need a Cloud compatible board. You will find all compatible boards in the link below:\nArduino Cloud compatible hardware. Node-RED Setup Setting up Node-RED is simple, we will run it locally following the steps below:",
      "product_category": "Arduino Cloud",
      "chunk_id": "Node-RED::c2"
    },
    {
      "product": "Node Red",
      "file": "docling_chunks.jsonl",
      "text": "[Product: Node Red] [Product category: Arduino Cloud] [Element of Node Red: None] [Tutorial about Node Red: None] \n\n< Go Back Cloud Guides Getting Started with Arduino Cloud Cloud Editor Arduino / C++ ESP32 / ESP8266 MicroPython Python JavaScript Node-RED Alexa Google Home Hardware & Devices Cloud Interface Cloud Editor loT Remote App Features API Arduino Cloud CLI Cloud Business Cloud Education Application Notes Q Search on Docs Home / Cloud / Node-RED Node-RED Learn how to use Node-RED together with the Arduino Cloud. Liam Last Aljundi revision Introduction » 07/23/2025 Node-RED is a programming tool for connecting hardware devices such as Arduino with other hardware devices, APls, and online services easily using a web-based flow editor. It allows you to connect those different devices and services by connecting a combination of nodes that create your desired flow. In this tutorial, we will look into the applications of using NodeRED together with the Arduino Cloud.",
      "product_category": "Arduino Cloud",
      "chunk_id": "Node-RED::c0"
