      "product": "Alvik",
      "file": "docling_chunks.jsonl",
      "text": "[Product: Alvik] [Product category: Education] [Element of Alvik: None] [Tutorial about Alvik: None] \n\n2.3 Power Supply\nThe power distribution in the robot is explained by the following diagram:\nPower Tree Diagram\nThere are three levels of power inside the robot:\n+3V7, Description = From the battery, the reference level is 3.7 V but it can goes from 3.0 V to 4.2 V. +5V, Description = After the Boost Converter. +3V3, Description = After the Step-Down Converter",
