      "text": "[Product: Stella] [Product category: Pr Solutions] [Element of Stella: None] [Tutorial about Stella: Tutorial_Stella] \n\nARDUINO STELLA User Manual Hardware and Software Requirements Hardware Requirements Arduino Stella (SKU: ABX00131) (x1) Portenta UWB Shield (SKU: ASX00074) (x1) Portenta C33 (SKU: ABX00074) (x1) USB-C® cable (SKU: TPX00094) (x2) CR2032 battery (x1) (optional) Software Requirements Arduino IDE 2.0+ StellauwB library (designed for the Arduino Stella) PortentaUWBShield library (designed for the Portenta UWB Shield) ArduinoBLe library Arduino Mbed OS Stella Boards core (required for the nRF52840 microcontroller of the Arduino Stella) Hardware and Software Requirements Hardware Requirements Software Requirements Arduino Stella Overview First Use NearbyDemo Example Two-Way Ranging Example Support The Arduino Stella redefines location tracking with its advanced microcontroller, the nRF52840 from Nordic Semiconductor, and the DCU040 Ultra-Wide Band (UWB) module from Truesense. Tailored for modern tracking needs, the Arduino Stella excels in pinpointing warehouse assets, ensuring healthcare safety and automating smart buildings.",
