    {
      "product": "Alvik",
      "file": "docling_chunks.jsonl",
      "text": "[Product: Alvik] [Product category: Education] [Element of Alvik: None] [Tutorial about Alvik: None] \n\n1.3 Controllers\nAlvik comes with two main microcontrollers:\n- At the core of the robot there is the STM32 Arm® Cortex®-M4 that controls all the sensors and actuators.\n- At the top a Nano ESP32 acts like the main controller and can communicate with the STM32 through a set of dedicated APIs.\nSTM32F411RC, Product page = Link. STM32F411RC, Datasheet = Link. Arduino® Nano ESP32, Product page = Link. Arduino® Nano ESP32, Datasheet = Link",
      "product_category": "Education",
