lastic support to hold the motor in place, a screwdriver is required to open it. Motors, Quantity = 2. Motors, Details = DC Motor with magnetic relative encoder. Rubber wheel, Quantity = 2. Rubber wheel, Details = Rubber wheel with 34 mmof diameter. Inox steal ball9mm, Quantity = 1. Inox steal ball9mm, Details = Ball that serves as third support for stability. Ball caster holder, Quantity = 1. Ball caster holder, Details = Plastic support to hold the steal ball. INOX M3 x 5 mmScrews, Quantity = 5. INOX M3 x 5 mmScrews, Details = Phillips Screws of the robot. Battery cover, Quantity = 1. Battery cover, Details = Cover to hold the battery, a screwdriver is required to open it",
