    {
      "product": "Alvik",
      "file": "docling_chunks.jsonl",
      "text": "[Product: Alvik] [Product category: Education] [Element of Alvik: None] [Tutorial about Alvik: None] \n\nDescription\nArduino® Alvik is a powerful and versatile robot specifically designed for programming and STEAM education.\nPowered by the Arduino® Nano ESP32, Alvik offers diverse learning paths through different programming languages including MicroPython, the Arduino language, and block-based coding; enabling different possibilities to explore Robotics, IoT and AI.",
      "product_category": "Education",
      "chunk_id": "Alvik-datasheet::c0"
