      "file": "docling_chunks.jsonl",
      "text": "[Product: Portenta Machine Control] [Product category: Pr Solutions] [Element of Portenta Machine Control: None] [Tutorial about Portenta Machine Control: Tutorial_Portenta Machine Control] \n\nBoth devices can be programmed with the Arduino PLC IDE, a tool that simplifies programming the device through any of the five programming languages defined by the IEC 61131-3 standard.",
      "product_category": "Pr Solutions",
      "chunk_id": "Tutorial_Portenta Machine Control_Memory Partitioning::c2"
