      "text": "[Product: Nano 33 BLE Sense Rev2] [Product category: Nano Family] [Element of Nano 33 BLE Sense Rev2: None] [Tutorial about Nano 33 BLE Sense Rev2: Tutorial_Nano 33 BLE Sense Rev2] \n\nDepending on the commands received by the Nano 33 BLE Sense board, it will turn ON or OFF its built-in LED. Goals The goals of this project are:\nUnderstand what the UART is. Use UART communication between two Arduino boards. Hardware & Software Needed For this project we will need:",
