      "file": "docling_chunks.jsonl",
      "text": "[Product: Plug and Make Kit] [Product category: Kits] [Element of Plug and Make Kit: None] [Tutorial about Plug and Make Kit: None] \n\n2.3 Microcontroller\nProduct Name, Description = Arduino® UNO R4 WiFi. Microcontroller, Description = Renesas RA4M1 (R7FA4M1AB3CFM#AA0). Clock Speed, Description = 48 MHz. Power Supply, Description = 6-24 VDC via VIN, 5 VDC via USB-C®. Operating Voltage, Description = 5 V (RA4M1). Memory, Description = 256 kB Flash, 32 kB SRAM, 8 kB EEPROM. Peripherals, Description = Capacitive Touch Sensing Unit (CTSU), USB® 2.0 Full-Speed Module, 14-bit ADC, Up to DAC, Operational Amplifier (OPAMP). Communication, Description = 1x UART, 1x SPI, 1x I2C, 1x CAN (external transceiver required). Wi-Fi®, Description = 802.11 b/g/n (Wi-Fi® 4), up to 150 Mbps. Bluetooth®, Description = Bluetooth® 5. LED Matrix, Description = 12x8 red LEDs, fully programmable. Additional Features, Description = Real-time Clock (RTC), Memory Protection Unit (MPU), DAC, DMA. Certifications, Description = CE/RED, UKCA, FCC, IC, RoHS, REACH, WEEE",
      "product_category": "Kits",
      "chunk_id": "Plug and Make Kit-datasheet::c7"
    },
    {
      "product": "Due",
      "file": "docling_chunks.jsonl",
      "text": "[Product: Due] [Product category: Mega] [Element of Due: None] [Tutorial about Due: None] \n\nDescription\nThe Arduino Due is a groundbreaking microcontroller board featuring the Atmel SAM3X8E ARM Cortex-M3 CPU, making it the first Arduino board built around a 32-bit ARM core microcontroller. With its 54x digital input/output pins, 12x analog inputs, 4x UARTs, USB OTG capability, and 84 MHz clock, the Due offers enhanced performance and versatility for a wide range of projects. Compatible with all Arduino shields designed for operation at 3.3 V and compliant with the 1.0 Arduino pinout standard, the Due is a powerful tool for both beginners and experienced makers alike.",
      "product_category": "Mega",
      "chunk_id": "Due-datasheet::c0"
    },
    {
      "product": "Due",
      "file": "docling_chunks.jsonl",
      "text": "[Product: Due] [Product category: Mega] [Element of Due: None] [Tutorial about Due: None] \n\n描述\nArduino Due 是⼀款开创性的微控制器板，采⽤ Atmel SAM3X8E ARM Cortex-M3 CPU ，是⾸款围绕 32 位 ARM 内核微 控制器构建的 Arduino 板。 Due 具有 54 个数字输⼊ / 输出引脚、 12 个模拟输⼊、 4 个 UART 、 USB OTG 功能和 84 MHz 时钟，可为各种项⽬提供更强的性能和多功能性。 Due 兼容所有⼯作电压为 3.3 V 的 Arduino 扩展板，并符合 1.0 Arduino 引脚布局标准，是初学者和经验丰富的创客们的强⼤⼯具。",
      "product_category": "Mega",
      "chunk_id": "Due-datasheet::c57"
    },
    {
      "product": "Due",
      "file": "docling_chunks.jsonl",
      "text": "[Product: Due] [Product category: Mega] [Element of Due: None] [Tutorial about Due: None] \n\n1 Application Examples\nThe Arduino Due combines the performance of the Atmel SAM3X8E microcontroller with the flexibility of the Arduino platform, offering a versatile solution for developers, hobbyists, and professionals alike. With its 32-bit architecture and clock speed of 84 MHz, the Due delivers robust performance for demanding applications.\n- Embedded Systems Development: The Arduino Due can be utilized to create a real-time data acquisition system for monitoring and analyzing environmental parameters in industrial settings. By interfacing sensors such as temperature, humidity, and pressure sensors with the Due's abundant I/O pins, developers can capture real-time data and process it using the Due's powerful microcontroller. The system can then transmit this data wirelessly or via USB to a host computer for analysis, allowing for continuous monitoring and remote management of critical processes.\n- Robotics: The Arduino Due can serve as the brain of an autonomous mobile robot capable of navigating and interacting with its environment. By integrating sensors such as ultrasonic range finders, gyroscopes, and encoders, developers can equip the robot with perception capabilities to sense its surroundings and detect obstacles. Using the Due's abundant I/O pins and powerful processing capabilities, algorithms for localization, mapping, and path planning can be implemented to enable autonomous navigation. Additionally, actuators such as motors or servos can be controlled by the Due to execute motion commands, allowing the robot to move and manipulate objects in its environment autonomously.\n- 3D Printing & CNC Machines: The Arduino Due can function as a versatile controller for DIY projects. By interfacing stepper motor drivers and end-stop switches with the Due's numerous I/O pins, enthusiasts can create their own 3D printers or CNC machines. The Due's high-speed processing capabilities enable precise control of stepper motors for accurate positioning and movement.\n- Prototyping: The Arduino Due serves as an invaluable tool for quickly iterating and testing new ideas for IoT devices. By leveraging the Due's extensive I/O capabilities and compatibility with various sensors, communication modules, and actuators, developers can rapidly assemble and test prototypes of IoT devices. Whether it is a smart home sensor node, a weather station, or a remote monitoring system, the Arduino Due provides a flexible platform for integrating components, writing firmware, and validating functionality. With the Due's support for Arduino libraries and easy-to-use development environment, prototypers can focus on innovation and experimentation, accelerating the process of bringing ideas to fruition.",
      "product_category": "Mega",
      "chunk_id": "Due-datasheet::c9"
    },
    {
      "product": "Due",
      "file": "docling_chunks.jsonl",
      "text": "[Product: Due] [Product category: Mega] [Element of Due: None] [Tutorial about Due: None] \n\n2.2 Microcontroller\nAtmel SAM3X8E, Details = 32-bit ARM Cortex-M3 at 84 MHz. Flash Memory, Details = 512 KB. Programming Memory, Details = 96 KB SRAM (divided into two banks: 64 KB and 32 KB)",
      "product_category": "Mega",
      "chunk_id": "Due-datasheet::c11"
    },
    {
      "product": "Due",
      "file": "docling_chunks.jsonl",
      "text": "[Product: Due] [Product category: Mega] [Element of Due: None] [Tutorial about Due: None] \n\n12.2 微控制器\nAtmel SAM3X8E, 详细信息 = 32 位 ARM Cortex-M3 ，时钟频率： 84 MHz. 闪存, 详细信息 = 512 KB. 编程内存, 详细信息 = 96 KB SRAM （分为两个存储区： 64 KB 和 32 KB ）",
      "product_category": "Mega",
      "chunk_id": "Due-datasheet::c61"
    },
    {
      "product": "Due",
      "file": "docling_chunks.jsonl",
      "text": "[Product: Due] [Product category: Mega] [Element of Due: None] [Tutorial about Due: None] \n\nThe board provides an SPI interface and full access to its pinout as it can be seen in the following table.\nSPI pinout\n1, Function = CIPO. 1, Type = Internal. 1, Description = Controller In Peripheral Out. 2, Function = +5V. 2, Type = Internal. 2, Description = Power Supply of 5V. 3, Function = SCK. 3, Type = Internal. 3, Description = Serial Clock. 4, Function = COPI. 4, Type = Internal. 4, Description = Controller Out Peripheral In. 5, Function = RESET. 5, Type = Internal. 5, Description = Reset. 6, Function = GND. 6, Type = Internal. 6, Description = Ground",
      "product_category": "Mega",
      "chunk_id": "Due-datasheet::c23"
    },
    {
      "product": "Mega 2560 Rev3",
      "file": "docling_chunks.jsonl",
      "text": "[Product: Mega 2560 Rev3] [Product category: Mega] [Element of Mega 2560 Rev3: None] [Tutorial about Mega 2560 Rev3: None] \n\n5.4 ATMEGA16U2 ICSP1\n1, Function = CIPO. 1, Type = Internal. 1, Description = Controller In Peripheral Out. 2, Function = +5V. 2, Type = Internal. 2, Description = Power Supply of 5V. 3, Function = SCK. 3, Type = Internal. 3, Description = Serial Clock. 4, Function = COPI. 4, Type = Internal. 4, Description = Controller Out Peripheral In. 5, Function = RESET. 5, Type = Internal. 5, Description = Reset. 6, Function = GND. 6, Type = Internal. 6, Description = Ground",
      "product_category": "Mega",
      "chunk_id": "Mega 2560 Rev3-datasheet::c30"
    },
    {
      "product": "Due",
      "file": "docling_chunks.jsonl",
      "text": "[Product: Due] [Product category: Mega] [Element of Due: None] [Tutorial about Due: None] \n\nArduino Due 集 Atmel SAM3X8E 微控制器的性能和 Arduino 平台的灵活性于⼀⾝，为开发⼈员、业余爱好者和专业⼈⼠ 提供了⼀种多功能解决⽅案。 Due 采⽤ 32 位架构，时钟频率为 84 MHz ，可为要求苛刻的应⽤提供强⼤的性能。\n- 嵌⼊式系统开发： Arduino Due 可⽤于创建实时数据采集系统，以监测和分析⼯业环境参数。通过将温度、湿度和压 ⼒传感器等传感器与 Due 丰富的 I/O 引脚连接，开发⼈员可以捕获实时数据，并使⽤ Due 功能强⼤的微控制器进⾏处 理。然后，系统可以通过⽆线或 USB 将这些数据传输到主机进⾏分析，从⽽实现对关键过程的持续监测和远程管理。\n- 机器⼈技术： Arduino Due 可作为⾃主移动机器⼈的⼤脑，能够导航并与环境互动。通过集成超声波测距仪、陀螺仪 和编码器等传感器，开发⼈员可以为机器⼈配备感知能⼒，以感知周围环境并检测障碍物。利⽤ Due 丰富的 I/O 引脚 和强⼤的处理能⼒，可以实施定位、绘图和路径规划算法，从⽽实现⾃主导航。此外， Due 还可控制电机或伺服器等 执⾏器来执⾏运动指令，使机器⼈能够⾃主移动和操控环境中的物体。\n- 3D 打印和数控机床： Arduino Due 可作为 DIY 项⽬的多功能控制器。通过将步进电机驱动器和限位开关与 Due 的众 多 I/O 引脚相连接，爱好者们可以制造⾃⼰的 3D 打印机或数控机床。 Due 的⾼速处理能⼒可精确控制步进电机，实 现精确定位和移动。\n- 原型设计： Arduino Due 是快速迭代和测试物联⽹设备新想法的宝贵⼯具。利⽤ Due ⼴泛的输⼊ / 输出功能以及与各 种传感器、通信模块和执⾏器的兼容性，开发⼈员可以快速组装和测试物联⽹设备原型。⽆论是智能家居传感器节 点、⽓象站还是远程监控系统， Arduino Due 都提供了⼀个灵活的平台，便于集成组件、编写固件和验证功能。凭借 Due 对 Arduino 库的⽀持和易于使⽤的开发环境，原型设计⼈员可以专注于创新和实验，加速将想法转化为现实的过 程。",
      "product_category": "Mega",
      "chunk_id": "Due-datasheet::c59"
    },
    {
      "product": "Mega 2560 Rev3",
      "file": "docling_chunks.jsonl",
      "text": "[Product: Mega 2560 Rev3] [Product category: Mega] [Element of Mega 2560 Rev3: None] [Tutorial about Mega 2560 Rev3: None] \n\n描述\n与 Arduino 的其他开发板相⽐， Arduino® Mega 2560 Rev3 是⼀款⽤于构建⼴泛应⽤的⽰范性开发板。该电路板内置 ATmega2560 微控制器，⼯作频率为 16 MHz 。电路板包含 54 个数字输⼊ / 输出引脚、 16 个模拟输⼊、 4 个 UART （硬件 串⾏端⼝） 、⼀个 USB 连接、⼀个电源插孔、⼀个 ICSP 接头和⼀个复位按钮。",
      "product_category": "Mega",
      "chunk_id": "Mega 2560 Rev3-datasheet::c44"
    },
    {
      "product": "GIGA R1 WiFi",
      "file": "docling_chunks.jsonl",
      "text": "[Product: GIGA R1 WiFi] [Product category: Mega] [Element of GIGA R1 WiFi: None] [Tutorial about GIGA R1 WiFi: None] \n\n9 Onboard Memories\nThe GIGA R1 WiFi supplements the 2 MB Flash and 1 MB SRAM on the STM32H747 (U1) with 16 MB of NOR Flash with the AT25SF128A-MHB-T (U8) as well as 8 MB of SDRAM with the AS4C4M16SA (U3). U8 connects over a QuadSPI interface to the main processor (U1). U3 operates at a frequency of 166 MHz.",
      "product_category": "Mega",
      "chunk_id": "GIGA R1 WiFi-datasheet::c16"
    },
    {
      "product": "GIGA R1 WiFi",
      "file": "docling_chunks.jsonl",
      "text": "[Product: GIGA R1 WiFi] [Product category: Mega] [Element of GIGA R1 WiFi: None] [Tutorial about GIGA R1 WiFi: None] \n\n14.1 Three-Pins Header - J1\n1, Function = OFF. 1, Type = Digital. 1, Description = 3V3 Enable Pin (U6). 2, Function = GND. 2, Type = Power. 2, Description = Ground. 3, Function = VRTC. 3, Type = Reset. 3, Description = Real Time Clock Battery",
      "product_category": "Mega",
      "chunk_id": "GIGA R1 WiFi-datasheet::c25"
    }
  ]
