      "text": "[Product: GIGA R1 WiFi] [Product category: Mega] [Element of GIGA R1 WiFi: None] [Tutorial about GIGA R1 WiFi: None] \n\n6.1 Front View\nTop View of Arduino GIGA R1 WiFi\nU1, Description = STM32H7 Dual Core Microcontroller IC. U1, Ref. = U8. U1, Description = AT25SF128A-MHB-T 16 MB Flash IC. U3, Description = AS4C4M16SA 8MB SDRAM IC. U3, Ref. = U4. U3, Description = ATECC608A-MAHDA-T Secure Element IC. U5, Description = LBEE5KL1DX-883 Wi-Fi®/Bluetooth® Module. U5, Ref. = U6. U5, Description = MP2322GQH Buck Converter 3.3V IC. U7, Description = MP2269GD-Z Buck Converter 5V IC. U7, Ref. = JANALOG. U7, Description = Analog input/output headers. JDIGITAL, Description = Digital input/output headers. JDIGITAL, Ref. = JSIDE. JDIGITAL, Description = Digital input/output headers. SPI, Description = SPI headers. SPI, Ref. = JTAG. SPI, Description = JTAG Headers. J2, Description = USB 2.0 A Host. J2, Ref. = J15. J2, Description = 3.5 mmaudio in/out. PB1, Description = RESET Button. PB1, Ref. = PB2. PB1, Description = BOOT0 button. J14, Description = Micro UFL connector. J14, Ref. = J5. J14, Description = Camera. J6, Description = Camera. J6, Ref. = DL1. J6, Description = Power LED. DL2, Description = RGB SMLP34RGB2W3 Common anode LED. DL2, Ref. = J12. DL2, Description = CX90B-16P USB-C® connector",
